\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\;(\\operatorname{LeftLinear}(G)\\land L(G)=L).\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}regular\\text{-}grammar\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}L\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists G\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\;(\\operatorname{RightLinear}(G)\\land L(G)=L)\\\\&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists G\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\;(\\operatorname{LeftLinear}(G)\\land L(G)=L).\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>右线性产生式拆成字符路径即可构造有限 ε-NFA。反向给每个 DFA 状态一个变量，转移 p─a→q 给规则 p→aq，终态给规则 p→ε；按词长对应运行与推导。左线性由反转规则和语言反向封闭得到。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-right-left-linear-grammars","status":"resolved","id":"10905704fde5f850","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-right-left-linear-grammars]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-generated-language","status":"resolved","id":"97562bc4aa1d6014","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-generated-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-automaton-language-class","status":"resolved","id":"c284ffb568a496fd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-right-left-linear-grammars","status":"resolved","id":"10905704fde5f850","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$，$L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$；线性文法、生成语言、正则语言分别见 [[73-df-right-left-linear